{"title":"Career Roadmap: Herbal Farm Manager","role":"Herbal Farm Manager","summary":"Career Domain: Agriculture, Food & Life Sciences · Qualification Pathway: B.Sc – Medicinal & Aromatic Plants / Floriculture / Landscaping · Target Career: Herbal Farm Manager","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Hons) Agriculture and Allied","Course":"Medicinal & Aromatic Plants / Floriculture / Landscaping"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Herbal Farm Manager grows medicinal and aromatic plants - ashwagandha, tulsi, lemongrass, mint - managing cultivation, quality, harvest and sale to herbal and pharma companies."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Herbal Farm Manager does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plan cultivation of medicinal and aromatic crops"},{"text":"Follow good agricultural and collection practices"},{"text":"Manage harvest, drying and storage"},{"text":"Sell to buyers under contracts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Herbal and aromatic farms"},{"text":"Ayurvedic and herbal companies (contract farming)"},{"text":"FPOs"},{"text":"Research farms (e.g. CSIR-CIMAP)"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Farm Supervisor"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Herbal Farm Manager"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Senior Manager"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Head of Cultivation"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Own herbal farm"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1: Basics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Agronomy and botany"},{"text":"Learn key medicinal plants"},{"text":"Visit a herbal farm"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2: Medicinal and aromatic crops"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cultivation of medicinal and aromatic plants"},{"text":"Post-harvest processing and distillation"},{"text":"Organic practices"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3: Experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Intern with a herbal farm or CSIR-CIMAP"},{"text":"Learn GACP guidelines"},{"text":"Learn buyer contracts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4: Prepare to manage"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"RAWE / ELP on a herbal farm"},{"text":"Write a farm business plan (NMPB support)"},{"text":"Apply or plan your own farm"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Medicinal-crop cultivation"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"GACP"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Post-harvest processing"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Contract farming"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Planning"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Team management"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Business sense"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Farm records"},{"text":"Distillation units"},{"text":"Excel"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Herbal farms"},{"text":"CSIR-CIMAP"},{"text":"Herbal companies"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Medicinal plants cultivation training (NMPB / CIMAP)"},{"text":"Organic certification awareness (NPOP / PGS-India)"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on the certifying body's official website."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Options afte